	)
	(text
		"PART NOTES (VERIFY = check against vendor datasheet before release)\nU11: Internal GNSS unused (no NavIC); NEO-F10N used instead\nJ5: AIS-140 production: replace by MFF2 eSIM on the same SIM bus (rev B footprint)"
